        <h2 class="fd-section-title mt-5" data-en="Broadcast & Editing" data-ne="प्रसारण तथा सम्पादन">Broadcast &amp; Editing</h2>

        <div class="fd-info-box">
            <h4 data-en="Television & Video Editing" data-ne="टेलिभिजन तथा भिडियो सम्पादन">Television &amp; Video Editing</h4>
            <p data-en="From 2067 to 2069 B.S., Kiran Chamling Rai worked extensively at Himshikhar Television as a control room operator and video editor. This role allowed him to understand the technical aspects of media production, from live broadcasting to post-production editing."
               data-ne="२०६७ सालदेखि २०६९ सालसम्म किरण चाम्लिङ राईले हिमशिखर टेलिभिजनमा कन्ट्रोल रुम अपरेटर तथा भिडियो सम्पादकको रूपमा व्यापक रूपमा काम गरे। यस भूमिकाले उनलाई प्रत्यक्ष प्रसारणदेखि पोस्ट-प्रोडक्सन सम्पादनसम्मको मिडिया उत्पादनको प्राविधिक पक्षहरू बुझ्न अनुमति दियो।">
                From 2067 to 2069 B.S., Kiran Chamling Rai worked extensively at Himshikhar Television as a control room operator and video editor. This role allowed him to understand the technical aspects of media production, from live broadcasting to post-production editing.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3" data-en="Furthermore, he expanded his skills by working in video editing at Mila Production House and Point Production House. He also contributed his technical expertise to the Nepali feature film 'Jhōle'. His background in editing gives him a unique perspective on storytelling and visual rhythm, which he brings to his directorial projects."
               data-ne="यसबाहेक, उनले Mila Production House र Point Production House मा भिडियो सम्पादन गरेर आफ्नो सीप विस्तार गरे। उनले नेपाली कथानक चलचित्र 'झोले' मा पनि आफ्नो प्राविधिक विशेषज्ञता योगदान गरे। सम्पादनमा उनको पृष्ठभूमिले उनलाई कथा भन्ने र दृश्य लयको बारेमा एक अद्वितीय दृष्टिकोण दिन्छ, जुन उनी आफ्ना निर्देशन परियोजनाहरूमा ल्याउँछन्।">
                Furthermore, he expanded his skills by working in video editing at Mila Production House and Point Production House. He also contributed his technical expertise to the Nepali feature film 'Jhōle'. His background in editing gives him a unique perspective on storytelling and visual rhythm, which he brings to his directorial projects.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="fd-info-box">
            <h4 data-en="Radio Dramas & Music Videos" data-ne="रेडियो नाटक तथा म्युजिक भिडियो">Radio Dramas &amp; Music Videos</h4>
            <p data-en="Beyond television and film, Rai has also made significant contributions to radio. He showcased his vocal acting skills in the radio drama 'Maisari Sunkhari', which was associated with the Anetena Foundation Nepal. He also acted in 'Mitini', a popular radio drama broadcast by Radio Sagarmatha, connecting with audiences through the power of audio storytelling."
               data-ne="टेलिभिजन र चलचित्र बाहेक, राईले रेडियोमा पनि महत्त्वपूर्ण योगदान पुर्‍याएका छन्। उनले Anetena Foundation Nepal सँग सम्बन्धित रेडियो नाटक 'माइसरि सुनखरि' मा आफ्नो स्वर अभिनय कौशल देखाए। उनले रेडियो सगरमाथाबाट प्रसारण हुने लोकप्रिय रेडियो नाटक 'मितिनि' मा पनि अभिनय गरे, जसले श्रव्य कथा भन्ने शक्तिको माध्यमबाट दर्शकहरूसँग जोडियो।">
